      {
        "id": "length-vs-capacity",
        "moduleId": "sequential-operations",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "length 与 listsize 不是一回事",
        "markdown": "`length` 是已有元素个数，`listsize` 是还能容纳多少元素的上限。判断“表满”要看 `L.length >= L.listsize`，而不是看 `length` 是否等于某个固定常量。扩容由 `realloc` 完成，基址可能改变，因此扩容后必须用返回的新基址更新 `L.elem`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "sequential-list-struct"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "sequential-insert",
        "moduleId": "sequential-operations",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "顺序表的插入",
        "markdown": "插入要使长度为 $n$ 的表 $(a_1,\\dots,a_{i-1},a_i,\\dots,a_n)$ 变成 $(a_1,\\dots,a_{i-1},b,a_i,\\dots,a_n)$，合法位置为 $1\\leqslant i\\leqslant n+1$。\n\n1. 检查 $i$ 是否合法；\n2. 若 `L.length >= L.listsize`，用 `realloc` 增加 `LISTINCREMENT` 个元素的空间，并更新基址与容量；\n3. 令 `q = &L.elem[i-1]`，从表尾 `p = &L.elem[L.length-1]` 开始，在 `p >= q` 时把元素依次右移一位；\n4. 把 `e` 写入 `*q`，`length` 加 1。\n\n除 $i=n+1$ 的表尾插入外，都必须移动元素。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6ea5f19a3c614ba8cee7df46",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000032"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机精品学习资料大放送",
                "算法 2.4"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1064,
              "lineEnd": 1098,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2e2669c7fe888c1a9d4e846e2f937cb29af2237f3364d57bc50b810c5a7d74e7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "sequential-delete-move",
        "moduleId": "sequential-operations",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "顺序表的删除与平均移动次数",
        "markdown": "删除要使 $(a_1,\\dots,a_{i-1},a_i,a_{i+1},\\dots,a_n)$ 变成 $(a_1,\\dots,a_{i-1},a_{i+1},\\dots,a_n)$，合法位置为 $1\\leqslant i\\leqslant n$。步骤是：检查 $i$；用 `p = &L.elem[i-1]` 定位被删元素并先把值存入 `e`；从 `p+1` 到表尾依次左移一位；最后 `length` 减 1。\n\n插入与删除的时间主要花在移动元素上。在第 $i$ 个元素之前插入要移动 $n-i+1$ 个元素，删除第 $i$ 个元素要移动 $n-i$ 个元素。若各位置等概率，则平均移动次数为\n\n$$E_{is}=\\frac{1}{n+1}\\sum_{i=1}^{n+1}(n-i+1)=\\frac{n}{2},\\qquad E_{dl}=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(n-i)=\\frac{n-1}{2}$$\n\n也就是说，插入或删除平均约移动表中一半元素，`ListInsert_Sq` 与 `ListDelete_Sq` 的时间复杂度都是 $O(n)$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6ea5f19a3c614ba8cee7df46",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000033"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机精品学习资料大放送",
                "算法 2.5"
